      "description": "<p>Four people, including a toddler, were wounded in the violence and one suspect was arrested, authorities say</p><p>Three people were killed and four others – including a toddler – were wounded in a shooting on Sunday evening during a food festival at an events complex near the Space Needle in <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/seattle\">Seattle</a>, a city fire department spokesperson said.</p><p>One suspect was arrested in the aftermath of the deadly violence, and a search for a second suspect continued into Monday, according to authorities. Neither suspect was identified, and no description on the one who remained on the loose was immediately available.</p><p><em>The AP contributed reporting</em></p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/jul/27/bite-of-seattle-shooting-center-food-festival\">Continue reading...</a>",
